{"2438110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Emergency Room Simulator", "steam_appid": 2438110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready for your shift?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a doctor in a chaotic emergency room, where every second can mean the difference between life and death. Explore a richly detailed hospital environment with authentic medical equipment, from first response in the trauma bay to bedside patient care.<br><br><strong>From Symptom to Diagnosis</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual exams, CT scans, X-rays, ultrasounds, ECGs, blood tests - run the right tests to confirm your suspicions. Listen to the paramedic's briefing, question and examine your patients, and ask the right questions.<br><br><strong>Find the Right Treatment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treat your patients with the right tools: administer medication, stitch up wounds, or apply bandages. Every treatment follows real medical procedures.<br><br><strong>Every Second Counts</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When things get serious, every second counts. Master time-critical emergencies like CPR and save lives when there's no time to hesitate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Medical Detective Work:</strong> Examine patients, ask targeted questions, run diagnostic tests, and log your findings in the patient chart</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You're the Doctor:</strong> Diagnose and treat your patients independently</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Choices Matter:</strong> Prioritize diagnoses at your own discretion and decide which path to take first</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save Lives Under Pressure:</strong> Perform time-critical emergency treatments where every second counts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Treatment Procedures:</strong> Treat wounds, administer medication, and handle injuries using real medical procedures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic ER Setting:</strong> Move through a detailed, immersive hospital environment with realistic medical equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Gameplay:</strong> Experience a balanced mix of quiet moments and sudden, high-stakes emergencies</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready for your shift?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a doctor in a chaotic emergency room, where every second can mean the difference between life and death. Explore a richly detailed hospital environment with authentic medical equipment, from first response in the trauma bay to bedside patient care.<br><br><strong>From Symptom to Diagnosis</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual exams, CT scans, X-rays, ultrasounds, ECGs, blood tests - run the right tests to confirm your suspicions. Listen to the paramedic's briefing, question and examine your patients, and ask the right questions.<br><br><strong>Find the Right Treatment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treat your patients with the right tools: administer medication, stitch up wounds, or apply bandages. Every treatment follows real medical procedures.<br><br><strong>Every Second Counts</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When things get serious, every second counts. Master time-critical emergencies like CPR and save lives when there's no time to hesitate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Medical Detective Work:</strong> Examine patients, ask targeted questions, run diagnostic tests, and log your findings in the patient chart</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You're the Doctor:</strong> Diagnose and treat your patients independently</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Choices Matter:</strong> Prioritize diagnoses at your own discretion and decide which path to take first</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save Lives Under Pressure:</strong> Perform time-critical emergency treatments where every second counts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Treatment Procedures:</strong> Treat wounds, administer medication, and handle injuries using real medical procedures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic ER Setting:</strong> Move through a detailed, immersive hospital environment with realistic medical equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Gameplay:</strong> Experience a balanced mix of quiet moments and sudden, high-stakes emergencies</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "In Emergency Room Simulator, step into the role of an ER doctor: run targeted tests, treat patients, and save lives when it matters most. Experience intense shifts in a fast-paced medical environment.", "supported_languages": "English, German, French, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Polish, Simplified Chinese, Turkish, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438110/879ad47f6d0dff3ce63cb60aa18b3bb5cb61c843/header.jpg?t=1787229288", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438110/aa13c5c7272c113ec9e8c2166ad8f5987c4bacd8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787229288", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438110/aa13c5c7272c113ec9e8c2166ad8f5987c4bacd8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787229288", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i7-4770K / AMD Ryzen 5 1500X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1060 6GB / AMD Radeon RX 6600 8GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br><